# Shuttlewreck Reef (CIPlay shuttlewreck_reef): the buoy, the cabin and its air, the manifest, two puffers, the luggage
# rack (goo, grass seeds, leather), the commuter's note.
island Shuttlewreck Reef
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Night Shuttle
zone surface_buoy
zone cabin
air cabin
expect step 1
read Shuttle manifest
expect step 2
kill Puffer fish
expect step 3
open Luggage rack
wait 3
expect item ExplosiveGoo 2
expect step 4
zone sw_ridge
expect step 5
zone sw_cave
expect step 6
read Seat 14's ticket
expect step 7
read Commuter's note
expect done
